    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rooney Auctioneers are delighted to introduce Massabielle\" to the market. Situated on the highly sought-after Fr. Russell Road, this exceptional detached residence enjoys a wonderfully private and mature setting, offering a rare opportunity to acquire a spacious family home on an extensive secluded site. Accessed through gated vehicular and pedestrian entrances, the property is surrounded by mature trees and landscaping, creating a tranquil oasis while remaining just minutes from all local amenities\r\n\r\nThe generous accommodation extends over two floors and is designed to provide bright, versatile living space throughout. A welcoming entrance porch leads into a large, bright reception hallway, setting the tone for the spacious interior.\r\nThe heart of the home is the kitchen/dining room, ideal for everyday family living and entertaining. Two generous reception rooms, separated by elegant double doors, provide flexible living accommodation and can be opened to create one impressive entertaining space. A delightful sunroom overlooks the private gardens and enjoys direct access to the rear patio, allowing seamless indoor-outdoor living.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor accommodates three spacious double bedrooms. The impressive main bedroom features a walk-through dressing room with extensive built-in wardrobes and patio doors opening directly onto the rear garden and patio, creating a peaceful retreat. Two further generously proportioned double bedrooms and a beautifully appointed main bathroom/wet room complete the ground floor.\r\nUpstairs, there are two additional well-proportioned bedrooms and a shower room, making this an ideal layout for larger families, guests or those working from home.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property is equally impressive. Set on a substantial, exceptionally private mature site, the landscaped gardens offer complete privacy and a peaceful setting. A large rear patio provides the perfect space for outdoor dining and entertaining. A car port and detached garage to the side offer excellent parking, storage and further potential, subject to the necessary planning permissions."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "A Home Designed for Family Living\r\nThis substantial and versatile home offers exceptionally generous accommodation\r\nideal for growing families, multi-generational living, or those seeking home office\r\nspace, all complemented by bright reception rooms and practical living areas\r\nthroughout.\r\n\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nGround Floor\r\nEntrance Porch: 2.43m × 1.64m Tiled flooring.\r\nEntrance Hall: 1.71m × 2.91mCarpeted with cloakroom/storage.\r\nReception Room :1: 4.50m × 5.95m Carpeted with feature open fireplace.Double doors to Reception Room 2.\r\nReception Room 2: 5.42m × 2.77m Carpeted with multi-fuel stove. Access to the kitchen/dining area and sunroom.\r\nSunroom: 2.67m × 3.30m Tiled flooring with direct access to the rear garden.\r\nKitchen: 3.73m × 3.28mFitted kitchen open to the dining area.\r\nDining Room: 4.09m × 2.44m Open-plan dining area adjoining Reception Room 2.\r\nUtility Room: 2.80m × 1.73m Fitted units with additional storage.\r\nMain Bedroom: 3.63m × 6.12m Spacious rear-facing bedroom with French doors opening onto the patio and garden.\r\nWalk-through dressing area with extensive fitted wardrobes.\r\nBedroom 2: 2.95m × 3.48m Bright front-facing double bedroom with built-in wardrobes.\r\nBedroom 3: 3.70m × 3.28m Rear-facing double bedroom with built-in wardrobes.\r\nBathroom 1/ Wet Room: 1.86m x 2.91m WC, WHB vanity unit, electric shower and fully tiled\r\nFirst Floor: Bedroom 4 3.06m × 2.43mBright bedroom with built-in wardrobes.\r\nBedroom 5: 2.50m × 3.96m Bright bedroom with built-in wardrobes.\r\nShower Room:  1.80m × 1.49m Fully tiled with WC, WHB vanity unit and pumped shower"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Key Features\r\nSpacious detached family home on a large, exceptionally private mature site\r\nPrestigious Fr. Russell Road location\r\nGated vehicular and pedestrian entrance\r\nTranquil, mature landscaped gardens\r\nLarge rear patio ideal for outdoor entertaining\r\nCar port and detached garage\r\nBright, spacious accommodation with five bedrooms\r\n\r\nOverall Floor Area: 197.2 sq.m (2,122 sq.ft)\r\nOil -fired central heating\r\nDouble-glazed PVC windows\r\nMains water supply\r\nMains drainage\r\nBlock -built construction (Built in 1974)"
      },
